Z||000001||RZURCTN||10-08-1999||10:29 PM||||I'm not too sure if that would be a good idea.  Baby seats are large and the center console is rather small.  Shifting would be a royal pain and you would be cramped.  Fieros weren't designed to be family cars.  I would think this through a little more and then ask yourself,"Is my child worth the risk?"  In the Marine Corps we call it "Good Initiative, Bad Judgement."<BR>||||reg||4
Z||000002||Patrick||10-08-1999||10:30 PM||||<BR>No offence James, but get yourself a bigger car.<P>When I have a passenger in my Fiero and I am sometimes forced to put a camera bag or something on the center console, I find it really distracting to have something there. I can't imagine how dangerous it would be to have a baby carseat located over the console.<P>It's too bad that we can't add <B>wav</B> files to our posts. You really need to be "gonged" for this suggestion.<P>Just my opinion...||||reg||13
